Subject: mouse-camera: hold the right mouse button to turn the camera with the
 mouse (DM_MOUSE_CAMERA=1, DM_MOUSE_CAMERA_SPEED; Mouse camera rows, off by
 default)

Idea from the fork survey (PranavDupati/ninboy-hat-for-macos, widmonstertony's desktop controls); written for NXForge's Mac front end, no code taken.
